<DocsLayout
  title="alert-notify Documentation: Angular"
  description="Use alert-notify in Angular as a recipe: import the core toast API from components or services. No Angular module ships."
  pageTitle="Angular"
>
  <p>
    <span class="tier recipe">Recipe</span>
    There is no Angular package export. Import the core API and call it from components or services.
    For a live demo and install snippet, see the <a href="/angular">Angular landing</a>.
  </p>

  <pre class="api"><code>{`import { toast } from "alert-notify";

toast.config({ position: "top-right", richColors: true });
toast.success("Saved");`}</code></pre>

  <ul class="notes">
    <li>Optional: call <code>toast.config</code> once in <code>AppComponent.ngOnInit</code>.</li>
    <li>Landing page: <a href="/angular">/angular</a></li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
